# Dependencies & build outputs
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/.turbo

# Tests & QA artifacts
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.playwright
packages/visual-regression/output
packages/visual-regression/.playwright
.visual-regression

# Git & IDE
.git
.gitignore
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.swp
**/*.swo

# Secrets & local env (never bake into images)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Logs & temp
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*
**/tmp
**/temp

# OS
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Docs & agent tooling (not needed for production builds)
**/*.md
!apps/api/prisma/**
.cursor
agent-transcripts
